# Constraint with [each ...] keyword for multi-class intersection
# Tests that fn@[bind: [a] constraint: [a: [each Comparable Showable]] return: a]
# applies both Comparable and Showable constraints to TypeVar 'a'

---
--- stage: type
or: [fn [a b] [kind: "union" members: [a b]]]
---

compare-and-show: [fn@[bind: [a] constraint: [a: [each Comparable Showable]] return: a]
  [x@a] x]

# Call with Int (satisfies both Comparable and Showable)
result: [compare-and-show 42]

result
---
EVAL
42
---
TYPE
Int
---
TYPECHECK-ONLY
